(Field note, stream bank near Kibilira.) Tj
T*
(I came back to this stream bank and made my own record of it.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(What I saw:) Tj
T*
(- The same layered sandstone the earlier report mentions.) Tj
T*
(- Walking further along the cut, the bank is steepest and the layers are cleanly exposed.) Tj
T*
(- Grain size is even across the three exposed beds, with the finest layer at the top.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(What I recorded:) Tj
T*
(- Photo 1: the whole exposed face from the far side.) Tj
T*
(- Photo 2: a close-up of the finest upper layer.) Tj
T*
(- Video: the bank from one end of the cut to the other.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(I did not hammer or pry at the face. This note is my own and sits beside the) Tj
T*
(earlier visit without merging into it.) Tj
T*
